# Audio Generation Rules

## Architecture Overview

```
User clicks "Generate"
  └─ soundscapeStore.handleGenerateInternal()
       └─ apiService.generateSounds({ sounds: configs[], ... })
            └─ POST /api/generate-sounds  →  routers/sounds.py builds the clip plan
                 └─ job_store.enqueue("sound", ...)  →  Redis queue:gpu
                      └─ workers/gpu_runner.py  [TangoFlux, loaded on demand, freed after 30 min idle]
                           └─ AudioService.generate_sound_file()
                                → WAV saved to temp/static/sounds/generated/<session_id>/
  └─ Poll GET /api/jobs/<job_id>  every 1500ms (via apiService.getSoundGenerationStatus)
       └─ Streams partial_sounds into generatedSounds as each clip completes
```

